# Cursor Product Configuration & Installation Architecture

## Overview

Cursor v3.7.21 is a fork of **VS Code 1.105.1** built by **Anysphere, Inc.** with extensive AI/agent features layered on top. This document covers the internal configuration that governs Cursor's behavior — the product.json configuration, extension replacement mechanism, AI feature flags, trusted domains, helper binaries, and licensing.

