## Security & Privacy

### Telemetry

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Telemetry enabled | `true` |
| Machine ID removed | `true` |
| Error telemetry | enabled |
| Usage telemetry | enabled |

### Content Security Policy (Workbench)

Cursor's workbench HTML defines strict CSP:

```
script-src: 'self', 'unsafe-eval', blob:
style-src: 'self', 'unsafe-inline'
connect-src: cursor-rpc-devtools (custom Cursor RPC endpoint)
trusted-types: 18+ custom policies
frame-src: vscode-webview:, http://localhost:*, http://127.0.0.1:*
```

**Custom Trusted Types (18+)**:
`dompurify#anysphere-ui`, `anysphereUiPolicy`, `aibubble`, `aibubble2`, `aibubbleSearch`, `ProseMirrorClipboard`, `shikiWorkerFactory`, `editorCppGhostText`, `solidjs`

